POST {{HART_API_HostAddress}}/api/Hierarchy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@company.com"
}

###

### Test Empty Email (should return 400 error)
POST {{HART_API_HostAddress}}/api/Hierarchy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

###

### Test Missing Email (should return 400 error)
POST {{HART_API_HostAddress}}/api/Hierarchy
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### Test Non-existent Email (returns success with count 0)
POST {{HART_API_HostAddress}}/api/Hierarchy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@company.com"
}

